    "text": "By Mike Peterson ,\n21 hours ago I’m glad to have run into this pair in this order, because Heller bucked up my spirits somewhat after Granlund’s negative take on election signs. It is indeed fall, and as much as I look forward to the foliage, this year I’m substantially happier than Heller’s semi-glum couple, looking forward to the midterms and glad we are offered a reset button every two years. Read full article",
